# `#[path]` that module tree was COMPILED TWICE, so `cargo test` ran its
# `#[cfg(test)]` blocks twice: once as `pathfinder_unchained::*::tests::*`
# (the binary's copy) and once as
# `rules_core::rules_tables::pathfinder_unchained::*::tests::*` (the
# library's). Only the binary's copy is gone.
